{title: Lord on High}
{artist: David Costello}
{key: E}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 129}

INTRO:  E  B  A  E – B  E  A  B – E  B  (C#m) (Bsus/e  E) – A  E  B  E

VERSE 1:

Whom have I but you oh Lord, to carry me through every storm
To hold me close and not let go, to rescue me in my hour of need
I proclaim my love for you, I proclaim my love for you
I will sing it over and over

CHORUS: (2x)

Lord on high You are everlasting, everlasting Lord on high
Lord on high You are ever-lasting, ever-lasting Lord on high

VERSE 2:

You will lead me and guide my path, keeping me on level ground
Watching every step I take, until I’m in the Promised Land
I proclaim my love for you, I proclaim my love for you
I will sing it over and over

CHORUS: (2x)

Lord on high You are everlasting, everlasting Lord on high
Lord on high You are ever-lasting  -  everlasting Lord on high

BRIDGE:

All the earth declares Your glory
All creation shouts Your praise 
Every knee shall bow – every tongue confess

CHORUS: (2x)

